<title>USA: Ciber Inc names Richard Montoni as CFO.</title>
<headline>Ciber Inc names Richard Montoni as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIBER Inc said Monday that it has appointed Richard Montoni as chief financial officer to replace Mac Slingerlend, who was promoted to be president.</p>
<p>Before joining CIBER, Montoni was audit partner for KPMG Peat Marwick LLP. CIBER said it also will nominate Montoni as a member of its board.</p>
